{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the future of mining!<br><br>You <strong>THE MINER</strong>\u00a0 operate a remote controlled miner-unit for limitless profit. Gather resources, upgrade your miner-unit and smelt a variety of precious metals. Mine deeper and you will encounter unexpected underground enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need a break? Take it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need something to do while waiting for a match in another game? Do some mining in between! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out some low urgency casual gameplay, and forget about the problems of the world with this simple mining platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GO MINING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indie single developer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime: 10-24hrs\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every asset is made by hand </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice-lines like you have never experienced before</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original relaxing blues inspired tunes (for the most part)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free Demo (2-3hrs) available</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787480?t=1753969513","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787480?t=1753969513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787480/30bd3eb4489b505a71922f6f26000733ef49adbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753969513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787480/30bd3eb4489b505a71922f6f26000733ef49adbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753969513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable wit